Z||000009||TwisT||02-10-2001||08:42 PM||||LOKI...<P>Here is the link to the related thread for those cool air intake panels:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/005701.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/005701.html</A> <P>Also,  here is the link to more pictures of Jerry's products:<BR> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=1315468&a=11483891" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=1315468&a=11483891</A> <P>Very nice stuff indeed...  I'm eyeing those "Lotus-like" rocker panels like crazy too.  and those extended wing pedestals...  Hmmm...  wondering if they will work on fastbacks???   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Brett||||reg||1
